A custom instance domain (the frontend-api <span pulumi-lang-nodejs="`fapi`" pulumi-lang-dotnet="`Fapi`" pulumi-lang-go="`fapi`" pulumi-lang-python="`fapi`" pulumi-lang-yaml="`fapi`" pulumi-lang-java="`fapi`" pulumi-lang-hcl="`fapi`">`fapi`</span> host or the <span pulumi-lang-nodejs="`accounts`" pulumi-lang-dotnet="`Accounts`" pulumi-lang-go="`accounts`" pulumi-lang-python="`accounts`" pulumi-lang-yaml="`accounts`" pulumi-lang-java="`accounts`" pulumi-lang-hcl="`accounts`">`accounts`</span> host).
